<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nebula Creative — Агентство цифрового превосходства</title>
  <style>
    /* ===== БАЗОВЫЕ ПЕРЕМЕННЫЕ ===== */
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #12121a;
      --glass: rgba(18, 18, 30, 0.7);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      --text: #e8e8f0;
      --text-secondary: #a0a0b8;
      --accent: #a855f7;
      --accent2: #6366f1;
      --accent-glow: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
      --gradient-1: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #6366f1, #3b82f6);
      --gradient-2: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444, #ec4899);
      --radius: 20px;
      --radius-sm: 12px;
      --transition: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
      --shadow-lg: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      --shadow-glow: 0 0 80px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    }

    .light-mode {
      --bg: #f5f5fa;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      --glass-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      --text: #1a1a2e;
      --text-secondary: #5a5a70;
      --accent: #7c3aed;
      --accent2: #4f46e5;
      --accent-glow: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.3);
      --shadow-lg: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      --shadow-glow: 0 0 60px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scrollbar-width: thin;
      scrollbar-color: var(--accent) var(--bg);
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 6px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      transition: background var(--transition), color var(--transition);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      /* убираем дефолтный курсор, если кастомный не отключён */
      cursor: default;
    }

    /* ============ ОТКЛЮЧЕНИЕ АНИМАЦИЙ ДЛЯ ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЕЙ ============ */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
      #particlesCanvas {
        display: none !important;
      }
    }

    /* ============ КАСТОМНЫЙ КУРСОР (только для десктопов) ============ */
    .cursor {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 99999;
      mix-blend-mode: difference;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, width 0.3s ease, height 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--accent-glow);
      display: none; /* показываем только если инициализирован */
    }
    .cursor-follower {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 99998;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transition: all 0.08s ease-out;
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
      display: none;
    }
    .cursor.hover {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      background: #fff;
      mix-blend-mode: normal;
      box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    }
    .cursor-follower.hover {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      border-color: #fff;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    /* когда курсор активен, скрываем системный */
    body.custom-cursor-active {
      cursor: none;
    }
    body.custom-cursor-active a,
    body.custom-cursor-active button,
    body.custom-cursor-active input,
    body.custom-cursor-active textarea,
    body.custom-cursor-active .service-card,
    body.custom-cursor-active .portfolio-item,
    body.custom-cursor-active .testimonial-card,
    body.custom-cursor-active .hamburger {
      cursor: none;
    }

    /* ============ ПРЕЛОАДЕР ============ */
    .preloader {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      z-index: 100000;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease, visibility 0.4s ease;
    }
    .preloader.hidden {
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .preloader-ring {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      border: 3px solid transparent;
      border-top-color: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
      position: relative;
    }
    .preloader-ring::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 6px;
      border: 3px solid transparent;
      border-top-color: var(--accent2);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 1.4s linear infinite reverse;
    }
    @keyframes spin {
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    /* ============ НАВИГАЦИЯ ============ */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: background 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s, padding 0.3s;
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      background: var(--glass);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      will-change: background, padding;
    }
    nav.scrolled {
      padding: 10px 30px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      background: var(--glass);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      list-style: none;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
      position: relative;
      padding: 4px 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .nav-links a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: width 0.25s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .theme-toggle-btn {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      background: var(--glass);
      color: var(--text);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .theme-toggle-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--accent-glow);
      transform: rotate(30deg);
    }
    .hamburger {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 1001;
      padding: 8px;
    }
    .hamburger span {
      width: 26px;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--text);
      border-radius: 3px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(1) {
      transform: rotate(45deg) translate(5px, 6px);
    }
    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(2) {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .hamburger.active span:nth-child(3) {
      transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(5px, -6px);
    }

    /* ============ ГЕРОЙ ============ */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      padding: 100px 24px 70px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #particlesCanvas {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 20px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
      transition: all 0.25s;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    /* ============ СЕКЦИИ ============ */
    section {
      padding: 80px 24px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .section-label {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.8vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .section-title span {
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    /* ============ СЕТКИ ============ */
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .service-card {
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px 24px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .service-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--accent-glow) 0%, transparent 70%);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .service-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .service-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow), var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    .service-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .service-card p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .stats-container {
      display: flex;
      gap: 30px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .stat-number {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-label {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .portfolio-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .portfolio-item {
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .portfolio-item:hover {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow), var(--shadow-lg);
      border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
    }
    .img-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b, #312e81);
    }
    .portfolio-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
      backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
    }
    .portfolio-item:hover .portfolio-overlay {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .testimonials-track {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      padding: 15px 0;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      cursor: grab;
    }
    .testimonials-track::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .testimonial-card {
      min-width: 300px;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 28px 24px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .stars {
      color: #f59e0b;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact-wrapper {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    }
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: border-color 0.3s;
      font-family: inherit;
      outline: none;
      resize: vertical;
    }
    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .back-to-top {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 25px;
      right: 25px;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gradient-1);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      z-index: 999;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5);
      transition: opacity 0.3s, visibility 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .back-to-top.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* ============ МЕДИА-ЗАПРОСЫ ============ */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav {
        padding: 12px 16px;
      }
      .nav-links {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 30px;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        transition: all 0.3s;
        z-index: 999;
      }
      .nav-links.active {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
      }
      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }
      .hamburger {
        display: flex;
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 90px 16px 50px;
      }
      section {
        padding: 60px 16px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .btn {
        padding: 12px 22px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .stat-number {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Прелоадер -->
  <div class="preloader" id="preloader">
    <div class="preloader-ring"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Кастомный курсор (будет скрыт на тач-устройствах) -->
  <div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
  <div class="cursor-follower" id="cursorFollower"></div>

  <!-- Навигация -->
  <nav id="navbar">
    <a href="#" class="nav-logo">NEBULA</a>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#hero" onclick="closeMenu()">Главная</a></li>
      <li><a href="#services" onclick="closeMenu()">Услуги</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about" onclick="closeMenu()">О нас</a></li>
      <li><a href="#portfolio" onclick="closeMenu()">Работы</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimonials" onclick="closeMenu()">Отзывы</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" onclick="closeMenu()">Контакты</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="theme-toggle-btn" id="themeToggle" aria-label="Переключить тему">🌙</button>
    <div class="hamburger" id="hamburger" onclick="toggleMenu()">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Герой -->
  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <canvas id="particlesCanvas"></canvas>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">🚀 Цифровое агентство №1</div>
      <h1>Создаём будущее уже сегодня</h1>
      <p>Мы превращаем смелые идеи в цифровые продукты, которые захватывают воображение и приносят реальные результаты.</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">✨ Начать проект</a>
        <a href="#portfolio" class="btn btn-outline">📂 Смотреть работы</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Услуги -->
  <section id="services">
    <div class="section-label">Что мы предлагаем</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Наши <span>услуги</span></h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🎨</div><h3>UI/UX Дизайн</h3><p>Интерфейсы, в которые влюбляются. Исследования, прототипы, визуал.</p></div>
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">⚡</div><h3>Веб-разработка</h3><p>Молниеносные сайты на React, Next.js, Node.js.</p></div>
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">📱</div><h3>Мобильные приложения</h3><p>Нативные и кроссплатформенные приложения для iOS и Android.</p></div>
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🚀</div><h3>SEO & Маркетинг</h3><p>Продвижение в топ поиска и соцсетей. Контент, реклама.</p></div>
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🤖</div><h3>AI Решения</h3><p>Чат-боты, рекомендации, автоматизация на базе ИИ.</p></div>
      <div class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">🛡️</div><h3>Кибербезопасность</h3><p>Аудит, пентестинг, защита данных.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Статистика -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="section-label">Кто мы</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">О нашем <span>агентстве</span></h2>
    <div class="stats-container" id="statsContainer">
      <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-number" data-target="250">0</div><div class="stat-label">Проектов</div></div>
      <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-number" data-target="50">0</div><div class="stat-label">Сотрудников</div></div>
